@startuml
title Diagramme de déploiement - TranscriBITE

node "Machine utilisateur\nWindows 10 / Windows 11" as PC {

    node "Navigateur Web" as Browser {
        artifact "Frontend React" as Frontend
    }

    node "Environnement Python" as Python {
        artifact "FastAPI Backend" as Backend
        artifact "Faster-Whisper" as Whisper
        artifact "Ollama" as Ollama
        artifact "FFmpeg" as FFmpeg
    }

    node "Système de fichiers local" as Storage {
        artifact "uploads/" as Uploads
        artifact "temp/" as Temp
        artifact "outputs/" as Outputs
        artifact "cache/" as Cache
        artifact "logs/" as Logs
    }
}

Browser --> Backend : HTTP
Backend --> FFmpeg : Traitement média
Backend --> Whisper : Transcription
Backend --> Ollama : Résumé optionnel

Backend --> Uploads : Lecture / écriture
Backend --> Temp : Fichiers temporaires
Backend --> Outputs : Résultats
Backend --> Cache : Données temporaires
Backend --> Logs : Journalisation

note right of PC
    Fonctionnement local et offline

    Aucun service cloud requis
    pour le traitement des fichiers.
end note

@enduml
